> Is Rcpp 0.11.3 available on CRAN?

yes. as can be seen here:
http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/Rcpp/index.html

The requirement for the very last version of Rcpp is something I’ve put in this morning. The reason for this is that it lowers the chances of getting usual problems related to binary incompatibilities.

Rcpp 0.11.3 is fairly new, so there is a chance you don’t yet get a binary version for it right now. But it should get there

Romain

